From: Peter M <petermm@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bsps/riscv: Add ESP32-P4 v3 BSP (riscv/esp32p4db)

Support revision 3.x only, with ESP-IDF clock transition and calibration
ordering and dual-core SMP. Reject incompatible silicon before clock setup.

Signed-off-by: Peter Madsen-Mygdal <petermm@gmail.com>
---
